# Datasets used throughout this project
## Datasets folder was added to .gitignore - This is because the dataset we are using is too large to be hosted on Github
Subsequently our datasets generated for binary classification throughout also resulting in being too big to be hosted on Github.

## You can find the original publically available dataset used in the experimental setup on Kaggle:
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/mlg-ulb/creditcardfraud  
You can use the Scripts provided to generate features and process the data to replicate the project.
